<title>USA: CCC seeks 27,000 tonnes HRW wheat for Eritrea.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 27,000 tonnes HRW wheat for Eritrea.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it will tender on August 11 for 27,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat for donation to Eritrea.</p>
<p>The shipment period is August 24 to September 13, 1997.</p>
<p>CCC seeks U.S. number 2 or better HRW wheat with minimum 11 percent protein.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408i 8720))</p>
